Modifications, as AGPL section 5 requires a modified version to state:

- Web search is mounted by default for new deployments (core/seed.ts,
  core/companion.ts), and the vendored websearch World stays mounted.
- A bundled World in core/web-fetch/ adds web_fetch (one page as Markdown),
  web_fetch_image (one image as an attachment, with a size cap and a refusal of
  local and private addresses), and web_search_images (picture addresses from
  Pixabay or Pexels). It has its own settings page.
- The desktop pet page shows the pictures a say message carries, one at a time
  with arrows, and enlarges one on a click (packages/cortico-world-desktop-pet).
- On Windows the update check and download use Node's https instead of
  electron-updater's network stack (app/node-updater.cjs).
- Release and update sources point at this repository, not upstream
  (electron-builder.yml, app/main.cjs, app/updater.cjs,
  console/features/release.ts).
- Tests and documentation follow the changes above.

